  "text": "24 Hour Emergency Vet in Irvine, CA | BluePearl Pet Hospital\nSkip to the content\nSpecialty and emergency consultations are now $199. Book your spot today.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Irvine, CA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nIrvine, CA\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n949.833.9020\n1371 Reynolds Ave.\nIrvine, CA 92614\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearlirvine\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nAdvanced Care. Greater Access. Exceptional Value.\nSpecialty and emergency consultations are now $199.\nBoard-certified specialists. 24/7 emergency care. Appointments available now.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – 24-hour emergency vet services for Irvine, Tustin and Greater Orange County\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Irvine is a 24-hour emergency vet and specialty animal hospital open 7 days a week, 365 days a year\n—\neven holidays. We are located in Irvine, California just 40 miles south of Los Angeles on I-5 in Orange County. We are close to Tustin, Turtle Rock, Costa Mesa, Lake Forest, Santa Ana, Anaheim, Mission Viejo, Huntington and Newport Beach and are open all day, every day to provide the care your pet needs.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care, 24-hours a day, seven days a week, in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl 24-hour emergency vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinary specialists here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Irvine.\nAt our pet hospital in Irvine, we seek to set an example in the field of veterinary medicine and aim to provide the physical and emotional care that your pet deserves.\nOur specialists’ expert knowledge is reinforced by the latest technological equipment in our field, allowing us to provide unsurpassed medical support for our patients.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Irvine, CA was formerly known as Southern California Veterinary Specialty Hospital.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n949.833.9020\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n949.833.9020\n949.833.7530\n1371 Reynolds Ave.\nIrvine,\nCA                                    92614\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nStudio City\nLos Angeles, CA\n11730 Ventura Blvd\nStudio City, CA 91604\n818.760.3882\n43.37 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFresno, CA\n7375 N Palm Bluffs Ave.\nFresno, CA 93711\n559.437.3766\n243.78 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMonterey, CA\n2200 Garden Road, #101\nMonterey, CA 93940\n831.899.4838\n301.63 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
